#  Negative control (emath-r3-nabla-pack-o6jp): 3D-arity curl. The 3D
#  curl OperatorDef is pending in the discrete stencil world; a 6-argument
#  grad-curl-form refuses typed instead of computing a wrong-world value.
use sci::physics::notation::nabla

emath function curl_3d_on_2d_world:
    inputs:
        u: Float64
        v: Float64
        w: Float64
        dx: Float64

    definitions:
        c = ∇×(u, v, w, dx)
